WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:37.810
Walk Inside the Light

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.310
Bring it on!  I'll take your anger and hatred!

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.320
I'll take everything!

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:49.480
Darkness in the planet’s heart!  Possess me!

00:01:56.910 --> 00:01:58.890
My other self!

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.640
What?

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.020
My other self!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.030
Stay away, partner!

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:26.680
This is my fight!

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:29.040
My justice and beliefs are at stake!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.410
No, my other self!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.570
Partner!

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:39.570
You can't use this card!

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:40.660
But…

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.440
He's waiting for you to use this card!

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:46.450
But if I don’t, I’ll definitely lose.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:49.450
Partner, this is my fight!

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:52.250
My justice and beliefs are at stake!

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.800
But I've changed.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:58.260
Partner, we'll go our separate ways someday.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:03.080
And we'll have to fight on our own.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.260
That time is now!

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:06.780
My other self...

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:09.770
I'm not done!

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:14.780
With this fight, I know what my mission is!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.040
It's what I - and everyone - believe in!

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:27.690
My other self, don’t be confused.  No matter how painful.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.120
Trust in our bond.

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:31.550
You’re not alone.

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:37.500
You have friends and monsters who believe in you.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:39.760
Partner...

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:45.770
Even when we’re apart, I’m... with...  you...

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.910
Partner!

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.490
My other self!

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:12.410
There's still something inside me that you can't burn away!

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:16.840
Nameless Pharaoh!

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.310
Ironheart!

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.390
Chris!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.200
Jonouchi!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.630
Jonouchi!

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.940
Jonouchi...

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:44.830
Rafael!

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:46.700
Kaiba!

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.430
Big brother!

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:59.220
Kaiba!

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:00.220
Big brother!

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:03.150
Big brother!

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.580
Kaiba!

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:09.160
Yugi, I paid you back.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.320
Don't let my corpse stop you.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:14.160
Kaiba!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:20.530
What's the point of trying so hard anymore?

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.960
Accept the truth.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:27.050
The truth is you're the Pharaoh with a cursed soul.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:31.040
If I place my hand here, my destiny ends...

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.890
It all ends.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.300
You'll return to nothing.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.830
I'll become nothing...

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:45.380
That's right.  I was originally nothing.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:48.960
I was sealed in the Millennium Puzzle.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:54.400
I had nothing from the start.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:58.750
Since I lost them, I have nothing left.

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.880
So I'll disappear.

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.960
I'm vanishing.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:08.810
There's nothing inside me.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.610
My memories...  My body…

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:47.120
I have them, even though I don't exist?

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:50.120
Something deep in my heart that can't be erased?

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.560
I see.

00:06:51.560 --> 00:07:02.130
I didn’t realize that my heart contains a vessel of memories that we created together.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:05.130
That’s my everything.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:07.240
I’m not nothing.

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:15.890
As long as I have this vessel inside me, I can keep reincarnating.

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:25.160
Our memories will never vanish!

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.860
The vessel of light!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:34.960
The darkness in this planet’s heart will vanish inside my vessel!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:48.160
My other self!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:23.040
The tidal wave is gone!

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.570
Is it a miracle?

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.970
My other self!

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:49.080
It's gone, partner.

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:52.490
Yeah!  You did it!

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.360
Dartz!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.080
Father.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.490
Dartz.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:11.500
Ironheart!  Chris!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:15.010
Father...  Chris...

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:16.960
Father!

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:18.010
Dartz.

00:09:18.500 --> 00:09:25.000
The Nameless Pharaoh took over your burden.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:27.050
Dartz.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:35.020
Yugi, thank you for saving my father.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.020
I want to thank you too.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:41.190
Now return to your world.

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:46.140
Your new future awaits beyond that portal.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:49.040
Ironheart.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.450
Chris!

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:57.770
Partner, let’s go back to our friends.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.300
Father, let's rest.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.580
Mother is waiting.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.040
Mokuba!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.460
Big brother!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.040
Get ready to take off!

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.930
Jonouchi!

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:07.080
Where's Yugi?

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:10.260
He's not with you?

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:12.900
Yugi!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:18.400
Big brother!  We have to leave!

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:20.900
Get on!  We're lifting off!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.100
Yugi!

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:23.720
Don't, Jonouchi!

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.440
What are you doing, Honda?

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.630
Don’t you care about Yugi?

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:31.440
We just have to believe that Yugi is okay!

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.800
Damn!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:54.850
Yugi...

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:01.370
Huh?

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.370
Where am I?

00:12:03.370 --> 00:12:05.260
Wasn't I...

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:09.880
Why are you here?

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:13.380
Well…  Hey, why are you here!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:15.880
Because…

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:18.060
Anyway…

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.780
I don’t know how I got my soul back.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.120
-Jonouchi!  You'll play!
 - Yugi!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.990
I’ll beat you next time!

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:44.440
Mirko...

00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:47.240
Look at this.

00:12:50.230 --> 00:12:53.080
Who cares about that piece of junk?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.640
This is my...

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.720
This belonged to my brother!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:02.600
Due to you, my brother...

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:05.190
Your company killed him!

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:09.630
You're wrong.  You couldn’t save your brother.

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:12.800
What are you talking about?

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.400
Don’t you get it?

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:16.110
You couldn’t save him.

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:18.340
That's when you lost.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:19.790
Big brother!

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:23.290
Amelda, If I were you…

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:27.920
I'd never have let my brother die!

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:35.730
Amelda, witness a true duelist’s power!  The chosen one’s glory!

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:39.840
Go!  Tyrant Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:49.140
Impressive, Kaiba.

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:01.440
Mirko.

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:13.230
Mirko, I’ll live for you.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:28.540
I…

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.550
I’m shaking?

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.890
Am I scared of him?

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:39.140
No, it’s not that.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.320
It means I'm excited.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:45.660
Let’s continue, Jonouchi!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.480
Burning Knuckle!

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:53.840
Big Bang Dragon Blow!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:14.450
Jonouchi, take care of Mai.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:15.780
Right.

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:19.560
Valon!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.380
Mai left.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.590
Jonouchi...  Valon...

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.730
What a fool.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:52.120
You said, "Never duel for someone else."

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:56.740
"Duel and win for yourself."

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:58.600
That's why you lost.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.080
Mai?

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:03.100
Valon did his best as a duelist!

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:07.020
I won’t even let you talk like that!

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:12.610
I learned something after fighting Valon.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:18.170
We communicated more by dueling than with words.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:21.620
I understood how he felt.

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:26.630
That’s why I'm taking you seriously too, Mai!

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:31.120
Then you’ll know how I feel.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:34.870
And I want to know how you really feel!

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:49.120
You win, Mai.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:52.860
Jonouchi!

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:55.500
Valon's duel already wore you out.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:59.160
Sorry.  I can’t see your face anymore.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:02.100
This duel was fun.

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.340
No!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:14.940
Jonouchi!

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:16.940
No!

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:18.820
No, Jonouchi!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:25.330
I knew all along that winning like this wouldn't help.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:29.610
I knew all along...

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.700
Jonouchi.  Valon.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:39.220
I'll come back as a duelist worthy of you.

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:06.520
Where am I?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:10.240
We were saved?

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:14.750
An aurora!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.970
Dark Magician Girl!

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:26.860
Timaeus!  Critias!  Hermos!

00:18:26.860 --> 00:18:29.450
Thank you, my two masters.

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:34.430
You saved your world and the Duel Monsters world.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:42.220
We'll take the souls freed from the god of Orichalcos who no longer have physical bodies.

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:48.020
I'm sure they'll help us build a perfect world of Duel Monsters.

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:50.380
Dark Magician Girl.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:53.880
Thank you, Nameless Pharaoh and Yugi.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.120
Now our mission...

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:58.110
…is complete!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.120
I'm the one who should thank you.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:06.130
Without your help, I couldn't have overcome the darkness in my heart.

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:11.630
Farewell, Nameless Pharaoh!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.140
Master.

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:24.770
It's nothing.  Bye!

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.920
What's going on?  Auroras again?

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:39.570
That's...

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.470
Dark Magician Girl and the legendary knights.

00:19:48.470 --> 00:19:51.930
They’re going home to the Duel Monsters world.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.940
My Hermos card!

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:12.640
It was all a dream or an illusion.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.220
Yugi...

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:18.470
Yugi?

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:28.250
Thank goodness.  Everyone's safe!

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:29.740
Yeah.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:38.780
Yugi!

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.010
Yugi!

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:42.280
Yugi!

00:20:42.480 --> 00:20:45.720
Take this!  You made me worry!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.810
Yugi, welcome back!

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:49.160
Thanks, everyone!

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:50.670
Yugi!

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:53.400
Let’s go home!

00:20:53.400 --> 00:20:54.240
Yeah!

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:57.340
Hurry up or we’ll leave you behind!

00:20:57.340 --> 00:21:02.940
Sheesh.  Once he knows Yugi's okay, his attitude changes.

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.100
Be quiet!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.440
My other self.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:24.740
Dark Magician Girl was going to say that this planet's curse is sealed inside my other self.

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:31.730
If the darkness in his heart overtakes him again, the curse will revive.

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.730
But I’m not worried about that.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:39.740
Because my other self has changed.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:45.740
He's overcome the darkness in his heart and seized the light.

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:48.760
He's been reborn as a true Pharaoh!

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:09.520
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:17.890
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:29.050
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:38.540
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:47.600
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:53.110
I'll live feeling them

00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:58.260
For me to be me

00:22:58.260 --> 00:23:06.750
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:12.390
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:22.050
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:33.150
The fight against Doma has finally ended, and the world escaped destruction.

00:23:33.150 --> 00:23:37.430
But that fight really made us think.

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:41.930
Yugi, Jonouchi and Kaiba - good job!

00:23:41.930 --> 00:23:46.180
Since we're in America, let's enjoy our time here.

00:23:46.180 --> 00:23:50.570
Huh?  We have no money to fly home?

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:53.580
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
 KC Grand Prix Begins

00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:55.360
Duel, standby!
